title: 22 - This is a drum kit, technically?

cover_description: The title text sits at the top, in green, above the gameboy interface in green and black like an old school computer terminal.

cover: cover.jpg

-- synopsis
Chiptuning day 3, had less time to tweak the composition itself, but I did play around with the "kit" and "live" feature, so the arrangement / which instrument playing when was all done live.

